{"unit_id":"rayzhu1109__dsh-balance#feature-balance","repo":"rayzhu1109/dsh-balance","commit":"70fc6bfe8bb25274db2b1fece46a040b6904f0be","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-balance 的功能「余额读取」：宿主端使用 DeepSeek API 密钥请求官方余额接口，并返回可用状态、币种、总余额、赠送余额和充值余额。侧栏按钮显示总余额，打开面板可查看各项明细。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:121-148","client/client.js:71-99","client/client.js:206-211"]}
